WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.660
Finally, the swing volley.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.660
A swing volley is attacking a high ball forward before it bounces.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000 line:5%
Banner: ball machines sold in 50+ countries

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.540
Move in quickly and hit at a high point, above the net tape.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.500 line:5%
Banner: ball machines sold in 50+ countries · Banner: pioneer in smart sports equipment

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5%
Banner: pioneer in smart sports equipment

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000 line:5%
Banner: pioneer in smart sports equipment · Hit at a high point above the net tape

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.280
Hitting this high makes it easy to clear the net: a high hit rate and few mistakes.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.340
If you hesitate, move in too late and miss the high point, the ball easily goes into the net.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.080
So sprint in with big steps from the start, watch the flight of the ball as you run and time it right.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.100
Use the high-ball technique from earlier, together with your footwork, to attack the ball.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:32.160
Once you have these details, we feed balls with the ball machine and practise hitting.
